==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Gardeneel Bros.]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Professor A.]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
At this point, you're expected to have [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 1, 2, & 3. If you don't have them yet, go grind for them.

This stage is pretty barren. Gardeneel Bros. die to [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]]'s level 7 Wave Attack, and Professor A. can get sniped by [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Awakened Mina]]'s Long Distance attacks by using Star Peng as a stepping stone. On higher magnification clears, you can just spam meatshields and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] for Star Peng, then Weaken Professor A. with [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] and try to sneak in [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] hits.

==Trivia==
*''Iwa'' (岩) is just the Japanese word for rock, so Iwa Rock Reef literally means "Rock Rock Reef".

